WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:07.055
Mom was looking at photos.

2
00:00:07.056 --> 00:00:10.987
"I have funny pictures of the kids.

3
00:00:10.988 --> 00:00:16.674
But I want a perfect family photo.

4
00:00:16.675 --> 00:00:20.917
It's for our holiday card."

5
00:00:20.918 --> 00:00:24.884
Mom hired a photographer.

6
00:00:24.885 --> 00:00:29.023
The Carters met him at Big Oak Park.

7
00:00:29.024 --> 00:00:35.016
They were all dressed in blue.

8
00:00:35.017 --> 00:00:39.851
The photographer took them to the bridge over the creek.

9
00:00:39.852 --> 00:00:44.824
A family dressed in red was already posing there.

10
00:00:44.825 --> 00:00:50.135
A line of families was waiting.

11
00:00:50.136 --> 00:00:59.591
"Ugh!" Oliver groaned. "I don't want to wait!"

12
00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:08.088
"Let's try the playground," the photographer said.

13
00:01:08.089 --> 00:01:16.901
But a family in green was already on the swings.

14
00:01:16.902 --> 00:01:25.018
Aunt Judy sighed. "I miss my green hat."

15
00:01:25.019 --> 00:01:34.230
Emmy saw the family's dog. "I miss Rover."

16
00:01:34.231 --> 00:01:40.666
"Let's try the field," the photographer said.

17
00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:46.604
One family ran through the grass for their photographer.

18
00:01:46.605 --> 00:01:52.367
Another family was holding hands and jumping.

19
00:01:52.368 --> 00:01:57.698
Both families looked perfect in their matching outfits.

20
00:01:57.699 --> 00:02:04.182
Everyone was smiling.

21
00:02:04.183 --> 00:02:08.592
Suddenly Mom frowned.

22
00:02:08.593 --> 00:02:13.568
"Our photo will look like everybody else's!

23
00:02:13.569 --> 00:02:18.327
I don't want that!"

24
00:02:18.328 --> 00:02:24.239
"I have an idea," Dad said.

25
00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:29.186
"But we have to go home."

26
00:02:29.187 --> 00:02:37.467
Everyone changed into their favorite clothes.

27
00:02:37.468 --> 00:02:43.439
Then they put a table and chairs on the lawn.

28
00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:48.399
Rover ran outside to help.

29
00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:52.083
"We're all here now," Emmy said.

30
00:02:52.084 --> 00:02:56.825
Mom smiled.

31
00:02:56.826 --> 00:03:07.906
"And ready for a funny photo that looks like us!"

